INSTALLATION

  1. Clone or unpack the files
  2. Include the directory 'parameter-balancing' (with all subdirectories) into your Matlab path
  3. Make sure that the following toolboxes are installed and in your Matlab path:
      o Matlab utility functions   (https://github.com/liebermeister/matlab-utils)
      o Metabolic Network Toolbox  (https://github.com/liebermeister/metabolic-network-toolbox)
      o SBtab toolbox              (https://github.com/liebermeister/sbtab-matlab)
      o libSBML Matlab interface   (https://sbml.org/software/libsbml/) - only needed for SBML model files
      o Matlab Optimization Toolbox
  4. To check the installation, run 'pb_run_tests' in Matlab


